# Derived artifacts (AST P5 net-off). One human source of truth — the prose under
# raw/ plus data/essays.json — produces these at deploy via `npm run build:artifacts`
# (and locally via the `predev` hook). They are build output, not committed: no
# blobs to drift, no --check freshness nag. The deploy rebuilds them from source and
# the regression suite proves them correct. See docs/specs/AST-COMPILER.md (Net-off).
# (sw.js and 404.html stay committed — they hold a generated *region*, not a whole
# generated file — and their freshness is gated by the post-build git-diff check.)
data/compiled/
data/search-index.json
data/offline-assets.json
data/site-registry.json
scripts/essays-data.js
sitemap.xml
feed.xml
rss.xml
